<title>USA: Pacific Fire Prot Dist., Mo., won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Pacific Fire Prot Dist., Mo., won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney said it won $2 million of Pacific Fire Protection District, Mo., general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.31 percent.</p>
</text>
